{"unit_id":"KitanWang__dsh-figma-plugin#feature-1","repo":"KitanWang/dsh-figma-plugin","commit":"1b11bee2145924f7b128746a3614b0f6265c8fbc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-figma-plugin 的功能「文件结构浏览」：读取 Figma 文件的页面与顶层框架，输出缩进结构和节点数量；可按深度或节点 ID 缩小范围，便于先定位目标画板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:674-760"]}
{"unit_id":"KitanWang__dsh-figma-plugin#feature-2","repo":"KitanWang/dsh-figma-plugin","commit":"1b11bee2145924f7b128746a3614b0f6265c8fbc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-figma-plugin 的功能「节点设计上下文」：获取目标节点的结构化布局、尺寸、颜色、排版、组件和绑定变量信息，并可附带截图；深度与节点数可配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:761-938"]}
